# Deny by default.
#
# This directory is Claude Code's live working state, not a config folder:
# it holds .credentials.json, session history, telemetry, and the memory
# files under projects/. Publishing it wholesale would leak all of that.
#
# So nothing is tracked unless it is named below. Adding a file to this
# repo is a deliberate act, never a side effect of `git add -A`.
*

!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!README.md
!settings.template.json

!agents/
!agents/*.md

!commands/
!commands/*.md

# settings.json is deliberately absent and must stay that way: it names a
# stealth project in its hooks and a client host in its permissions.
# settings.template.json is the redacted, shareable form.
